## 13. Tech Stack Summary

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Language** | Python 3.12+ (server), Dart/Flutter (mobile), JavaScript (Chrome extension) |
| **API Framework** | FastAPI |
| **Database** | SQLite (via `aiosqlite`) |
| **Task Scheduling** | APScheduler or Celery with Redis |
| **LLM Integration** | `anthropic` SDK, `openai` SDK, `ollama` Python client |
| **Obsidian Vault** | Markdown files on a shared filesystem |
| **Notification (Dev)** | `python-telegram-bot` |
| **Notification (Prod)** | Firebase Cloud Messaging |
| **Mobile App** | Flutter |
| **Chrome Extension** | Manifest V3, vanilla JS |
| **Deployment** | Kubernetes (Talos Linux cluster) |
| **Containerization** | Docker |

