## 14. MVP Scope

The MVP focuses on proving the core loop: **ingest data -> store -> summarize -> generate insight -> push notification -> receive correction**.

### MVP Connectors (Phase 1)

1. **Location** (companion app) -- proves the geofencing and activity detection pipeline.
2. **Google Calendar** -- gives the agent awareness of the user's schedule.
3. **Gmail** -- rich context about commitments, deadlines, communication.

### MVP Features

- [ ] Event store (SQLite) with normalized event schema
- [ ] Google OAuth2 flow for Gmail + Calendar
- [ ] Gmail connector (pull and classify emails)
- [ ] Google Calendar connector (sync events)
- [ ] Companion app with location tracking (iOS, Flutter)
- [ ] Companion app to host machine webhook pipeline
- [ ] Geofence management (manual creation + auto-detection)
- [ ] Daily digest generation (LLM-powered summarization)
- [ ] Morning briefing push notification
- [ ] Telegram bot for notifications and corrections
- [ ] Correction handler (parse replies, update vault/DB)
- [ ] Obsidian vault structure with daily digests and config
- [ ] Basic insight generation (weekly patterns)
- [ ] LLM provider abstraction (Claude + OpenAI support)
- [ ] Data connector plugin interface

### Post-MVP (Phase 2+)

- [ ] Plaid integration (financial transactions)
- [ ] Spotify connector
- [ ] YouTube connector
- [ ] Chrome extension for browsing history
- [ ] Advanced cross-source correlation insights
- [ ] Monthly trend reports
- [ ] Companion app push notifications (replace Telegram)
- [ ] Companion app HealthKit integration
- [ ] Companion app conversational interface
- [ ] Android support
- [ ] Local LLM support (Ollama)
- [ ] Real-time anomaly detection
- [ ] Obsidian plugin for in-vault agent interaction

